new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f036385
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr505.feature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+All :command:`pysemver` subcommands now accept an optional leading ``v`` or ``V`` on version arguments (for example ``v1.4.2``). The output never includes the prefix.
diff --git a/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst b/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..49a8daa
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Passing a :class:`dict` to :meth:`semver.version.Version.compare` is deprecated and emits a :class:`DeprecationWarning`. Use a string, tuple, list or :class:`~semver.version.Version` instead, for example ``Version(**mydict)``.
diff --git a/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst b/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..289f36e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+The ``prerelease_token`` keyword of :meth:`semver.version.Version.next_version` is renamed to ``token``, matching :meth:`~semver.version.Version.bump_prerelease` and :meth:`~semver.version.Version.bump_build`. ``prerelease_token`` still works but is deprecated and emits a :class:`DeprecationWarning`.
